        <mxCell id="n_cl02" value="BR-01: AssignmentStatus = TRACKING, PAUSED, AUTO_SUSPENDED, WAITING_CAPACITY, ENDED. Mỗi bác sĩ tối đa 30 ca TRACKING; PAUSED / AUTO_SUSPENDED không chiếm tải.&lt;br&gt;IntakeStatus = DRAFT, SUBMITTED, NEEDS_INFORMATION, VERIFIED, DECLINED, WITHDRAWN. Giao tiếp ChatUI/Message gắn phân công hiện hành." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#6B7280;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
